expected = "Only the authorized primary may append lifecycle and lease records to the standby WAL; the replication link must bind the sender to the configured primary identity."
proposal = "In node/sequencer/standby_role.go require mutual TLS with the pinned primary identity before reading replication groups, sharing the trust configuration with DialStandby and rejecting unauthorized control records before WAL append."
